<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys marks at PLN 1.8330 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys marks at PLN 1.8330 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) bought marks on the interbank market at 1.8330 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;medium&quot;, came at 1130 GMT when the zloty was at 2.51 percent from the floating mark parity rate for today -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>Earlier the NBP also bought dollars at 3.1410, 3.1411 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
